    "encrypted": "false",
    "long_instructions": "## Do This:\r\n\r\n1. Create a flowchart to model your own scenario.\r\n\r\n2. Save your flowchart to your **Backpack**.\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n### Mute Toggle\r\n\r\n- If the user toggles the sound to ON, set the volume to 50 and show the active speaker icon.\r\n- If the user toggles the sound to OFF, set the volume to 0 and show the slashed speaker icon.\r\n",
